  m_text: 'Each Dice can become very unqiue in the later stages


    Each Dice can
    be a different type that are buyable in shops

    Examples are: when a die is
    set aside +100 points to score or when a die is rolled gain +25 points for each
    other die rolled with it


    each dice can also have each face change so instead
    of of haveing the usual

    1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6

    you may have a dice with 
    faces

    1, 1, 1, 1, 5, 5'
