--- !u!114 &2097793554
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2097793552}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Reach the goal score before you run out of lives.\n\nEach turn starts
    with rolling all 6 dice. After each roll, you must:\nSelect dice that score points\n\nChoose
    to either:\nSet Aside: Lock in those dice, roll the remaining dice, and try to
    score more\nBank: Take your current score and end your turn (costs 1 life unless
    you got Hot Dice)\n\nIf you roll and nothing scores, you Farkle you lose everything
    you built up that turn AND lose a life.\n\nScoring (the only part that matters):\n\nStraight
    1-6 = 5000\nStraight 1-5 or 2-6 = 2500\nThree matching pairs = 1500\nThree of
    a kind: 1s give 1000, \neverything else is pip \xD7 100 (so three 4s = 400)\nFour/five/six
    of a kind multiply by 2 for each extra die\nSingle 1s = 100 each\nSingle 5s =
    50 each\n\nStart with 5 lives\nBank = lose a life \nFarkle = lose running score
    AND a life\nHot dice = if you set aside or bank all 6 dice scoring, you bank
    for free and roll all 6 again\n\nOn Round end you will gain money equal to lives
    \n+ set a side score divided by goal score (capped at 5)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ce59925d350ff644bb1e514285eeda3, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 440472713845906204, guid: 4ce59925d350ff644bb1e514285eeda3, type: 2}
